Note: Before upgrading APs via AC, please ensure APs can ping each other. Otherwise distributed upgrade may fail and upgrade time will increase significantly.
If port protection [switchport protected] is configured on the switch and prevents AP communication, enable proxy ARP on the AP gateway.
Example: Enable Proxy ARP on AP Gateway:
Ruijie(config)#interface vlan 50
Ruijie(config-if-VLAN 50)#local-proxy-arp
Ruijie(config-if-VLAN 50)#end
Ruijie#write
